    "northStar": "The Section Log",
    "overview": "A lease project drawn as the document the oil patch already trusts: a well log. Pale log paper, a cyan measurement grid on the hero and page-title bands only, ink-black 1.5px rules, boxed header cells, red/blue/green curve inks and one amber highlighter. Light only; square-cornered and ruled; condensed caps for structure, Barlow for reading, mono for numerals.",
