      "One accent action color (amber); red, blue, green are data inks.",
      "Condensed uppercase headings over calm 17px body.",
      "Status encoded by fill pattern as well as color."
    ],
    "rules": [
      { "name": "The One Highlighter Rule", "body": "Amber marks the one thing to do on a surface. Curve inks never become buttons or links.", "section": "colors" },
      { "name": "The Grid Stays Home Rule", "body": "The cyan grid lives only on the hero field and page-title bands. Body copy goes on flat paper or in a boxed note.", "section": "colors" },
